\fB\-v, \-\-verbose\fR
Log at INFO instead of WARNING.
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-port\-check\fR
Start even if something already accepts connections on the port.
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print help
\fBArguments:\fR
.PP
.TP
\fB<ACTION>\fR
What to do with the Grid process.
