\fB\-\-assert\fR \fI<SPEC>\fR
Assertion spec: element=<css>, text=<css>:<text>, title=<text>, or url=<text>
.TP
\fB\-\-spec\fR \fI<SPEC>\fR
JSON file containing an array of assertion specs
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print help
